# Compute prob_failure
# Compute lime_risk_score
# Determine SAFETY_MODE = True/False
# If safety mode:
# Use more aggressive retrieval: higher top_k, higher token_budget
# Add safety terms to query
# Re-rank chunks to prioritize safety content

# Else:
